<title>USA: Investment manager ups Mecklermedia stake.</title>
<headline>Investment manager ups Mecklermedia stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investment manager Barry Feirstein said Tuesday he raised his stake in Mecklermedia Corp. to 600,000 common shares, or 7.1 percent of the total outstanding, from 500,000 shares, or 5.9 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Feirstein, who owns the New York investment management firm Feirstein Capital Management Corp., said he bought 100,000 shares between Jan. 13 and Feb. 5 at prices ranging from $18.375 and $23.0536 a share.</p>
